  "text": "<b>gottim, fishing outside off!</b> Very similar to the first innings, the nip away does the job and Broad pockets Marnus once again! There's a moment's pause, as the umpires come together, but the front foot is okay. Labuschagne shakes his head, sucked into playing away from his body. Edgbaston comes alive, and England are alive",
  "postText": "But here comes Steven Smith, and <i>everything</i> just ramps up a notch. Broad and Root revving up the crowd. Slip and leg slip in",
